{"seq":4,"type":"response_ended","time":"2026-10-08T03:08:09.090721Z","response":{"stop_reason":"end_turn","from":{"vendor":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","surface":"messages"},"requested":{"vendor":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","surface":"messages"},"model_reported":true,"parts":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENT-2\n\n**AGENT-2** is a conversational AI system designed to provide helpful, accurate, and concise responses while maintaining context throughout conversations.\n\n---\n\n## Why Streamed Proposals Must Wait for Complete Validation\n\nWhen proposals are streamed, tool effects cannot execute until validation completes because:\n\n1. **Consistency**: Partial execution risks inconsistent system state if validation later fails\n2. **Atomicity**: Operations should succeed or fail completely, not partially\n3. **Reversibility**: Invalid partial effects are difficult to undo\n4. **User Experience**: Users receive accurate results, not potentially erroneous intermediate outputs\n5. **Security**: Validation checks authorization before any state changes occur\n\nComplete validation ensures reliability and data integrity."}],"usage":{"input":57,"cache_write":0,"cache_read":0,"output":166},"raw_usage":{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"inference_geo":"not_available","input_tokens":57,"output_tokens":166,"service_tier":"standard"}}}
